            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n\n\t<head>\n\n  <title>Complete Fragments: Screening Fragments from the TV Archive - Birkbeck, University of London</title>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width initial-scale=1\" />\n  <meta name=\"twitter:dnt\" content=\"on\">\n  \n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.bbk.ac.uk/events/event/58139/complete-fragments-screening-fragments-from-the-tv-archive\">\n\n  \n    <meta name=\"sluginfo\"\n    data-locationhref=\"58139\"\n    data-normalizedname=\"complete-fragments-screening-fragments-from-the-tv-archive\" />\n  \n\n  \n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Birkbeck, University of London\"/>\n\n\n  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"This evening screening showcases rare material demonstrating the challenges of creating and maintaining television archives.\" />\n\n\n\n  <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.bbk.ac.uk/events/event/58139/complete-fragments-screening-fragments-from-the-tv-archive\" />\n\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Complete Fragments: Screening Fragments from the TV Archive\" />\n\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"Birkbeck, University of London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@BirkbeckUoL\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Complete Fragments: Screening Fragments from the TV Archive\" />\n\n\n  <meta property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"This evening screening showcases rare material demonstrating the challenges of creating and maintaining television archives.\" />\n\n\n  \n\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://dist.bbk.ac.uk\">\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://dist.bbk.ac.uk/assets/favicon/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\"><!-- 32×32 -->\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://dist.bbk.ac.